# Copy to deploy/stream/.env (mode 600). With no key the stream stays private and
# records its last five minutes inside the container instead. With a key, starting
# it goes live.
TWITCH_STREAM_KEY=
# Twitch's own default ingest, which picks the nearest server. Optional.
# TWITCH_INGEST=rtmps://ingest.global-contribute.live-video.net/app
